      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation on LevelRenderer.renderLevel's RenderTarget.clear calls (records the entity-outline target's clear) and on doEntityOutline's blitToScreen call; @ModifyVariable tripwires at HEAD of GlStateManager._glBindFramebuffer (framebuffer id) and _bindTexture; @Redirect of BufferUploader.draw(MeshData)'s VertexBuffer.draw (left out only inside the skipped composite, only for the BLIT_SCREEN draw, once); helper bons.furious.patch.vanilla_outline_skip.OutlineSkip (runtime flag, SHADOW read-back probe, TIMING GPU queries). 1.21.1: renderLevel/GameRenderer.render take DeltaTracker, draw takes MeshData, the composite draws a BLIT_SCREEN quad and the blit shader carries no blend state",
